Package: GiottoConnect
Type: Package
Title: Giotto Interoperability and External Tool Connections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Giotto Suite Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "giottosuite@gmail.com")
Description: A hub for Giotto interoperability functions and connections to
    external visualization and analysis tools. The first major feature is a
    Vitessce viewer pipeline that converts a Giotto spatial single-cell object
    into a static Vitessce-powered website deployable via GitHub Pages. The
    pipeline exports the object to SpatialData-Zarr format, generates a
    Vitessce view configuration, and scaffolds a Vite/React application ready
    for GitHub Actions deployment.
